Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/cmp.c
Line: 2625
Function: print_itavs
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: OSSL_CMP_ITAV_get0_type(itav) is called before verifying that 'itav' is non-NULL. If the stack contains a NULL element, this call dereferences a NULL pointer; the subsequent NULL check on 'itav' is too late.

